# BABB Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for BABB.

BABB is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a historical token smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: BABB  
Audit type: Token smart contract audit and certificate  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Reports

[01_Certificate_BABB_BAX_ETH.pdf](./01_Certificate_BABB_BAX_ETH.pdf)

[02_Smart_Contract_Audit_BABB_Token.pdf](./02_Smart_Contract_Audit_BABB_Token.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed token smart contract security work.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to token contract security.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
